# Staged files for the eval cases. This folder is the project root of a run of
# ../cases.json (its `files` entries are spelled fixtures/..., which is where the runner
# stages them, and each case says so); before/ is the same for ../cases-before.json, over
# a sanctum seeded from the pre-leanness skill (git 8ba57cf) for the before side of a
# comparison. Everything here is synthetic: a v7 sanctum seeded by init_sanctum.py from
# the shipped templates (owner Robin, memory/.born written, tier Pro on record), a band
# profile and a WIP. No BMad config is staged, so Mac and the siblings run on module
# defaults. The sibling skills are staged from the repo's live .claude/skills/<sibling>/.
#
# Keep what the repo root .gitignore drops:
!_bmad/
!docs/
